        <span class="vent-diffuser__clip"><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span class="vent-diffuser__cap"></span>
        <span class="vent-diffuser__collar"></span>
        <span class="vent-diffuser__flask"><b>CHER</b></span>
      </div>

      <p class="art-caption">Made for<br>the journey.</p>
    </div>

